# 🌐 TrenchAssistant Frontend

This is the frontend interface for **TrenchAssistant**, a Solana wallet analytics tool. Users can input a wallet address, trigger a backend analysis, and view a detailed performance report based on enriched transaction data and market insights.

---

## 🧠 What It Does

- ✅ Accepts Solana wallet input from the user
- 🚀 Sends requests to the FastAPI backend to launch a wallet analysis session
- 🔄 Polls session status and displays progress
- 📊 Displays session results:
  - Total profit/loss
  - Win rate
  - Average and median hold time
  - Best and worst trades
  - Token-level performance summaries

---

## 🧩 Tech Stack

- **Framework**: React (or plain JS if you're not using a framework)
- **API Integration**: Connects with FastAPI backend via REST
- **Styling**: Tailwind / CSS Modules / [your styling choice]
- **Hosting**: [e.g., Vercel, Netlify, GitHub Pages, etc.]

---

## 🛠 How to Run Locally

git clone https://github.com/yourusername/trenchassistant-frontend.git
cd trenchassistant-frontend
npm install
npm start

Make sure the backend is running locally on port 8000 (or update the API base URL in your frontend config).

